{
  "openapi" : "3.0.1",
  "info" : {
    "title" : "hugmesh-mod-bff-api",
    "description" : "Moderator BFF API (/bff/mod/**) — federation moderation triage + refer-to-admin escalation, server-wide Matrix/Mastodon block (locally audited), and MOD-accessible federation module delivery. ROLE_MOD / ROLE_ADMIN only; no infra/server-admin surface.",
